  svg.addEventListener('mouseout',function(ev){\n    var t=ev.target;\n    if(t.hasAttribute('data-node')||t.hasAttribute('data-edge'))\n      tip.style.display='none';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n",
